asset:        EffectCraftTestBlocks.ttf
title:        Test font: "EffectCraft Test Blocks" Regular, one filled rectangle per printable ASCII character
author:       EffectCraft contributors
source:       original work
license:      MIT OR Apache-2.0
added:        2026-10-15 by comotion (P5)
notes:        Generated byte by byte from the public OpenType table specifications (head, hhea, maxp, OS/2, hmtx, cmap format 4, loca, glyf, name, post); no outlines or data taken from any other font. Used by the project-font tests (registration, rendering, CLI --font-dir, the web embed test).
